---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Projects
description: Selected analytics projects, from business questions and data preparation to findings and recommendations.
permalink: /projects/
---
<div class="page-shell">
<header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">the archive / selected work</p><h1>all the work, documented.</h1><p class="lede">A collection of analyses, dashboards, and data stories. Each case study connects the question to the method, the evidence, and the next useful step.</p></header>
<section class="project-list-section" aria-labelledby="project-list-title" data-project-list>
  <h2 id="project-list-title" class="section-label">Project collection</h2>
  <div class="project-toolbar" data-filter-controls hidden><div class="filter-list" role="group" aria-label="Filter projects by category"><button type="button" class="filter-button" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All work</button>{% for category in collections.projects | categories %}<button type="button" class="filter-button" data-filter="{{ category }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ category }}</button>{% endfor %}</div><p class="filter-count" data-filter-count aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">{{ collections.projects.length }} projects</p></div>
  {% if collections.projects | hasExamples %}<p class="section-note">These are clearly labeled examples to show how your work will look.</p>{% endif %}
  <div class="project-grid project-grid-all">{% for project in collections.projects %}{% set featuredCard = false %}{% set projectNumber = loop.index | pad %}{% include 'components/project-card.njk' %}{% endfor %}</div>
  {% if collections.projects.length == 0 %}<p class="empty-state">New projects are on the way.</p>{% endif %}
</section>
</div>
